{"4386260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "REDSTREAM DISPATCH", "steam_appid": 4386260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRUE BODYCAM HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REDSTREAM: DISPATCH is a first-person bodycam survival horror experience where you <u><strong>respond to escalating dispatch calls</strong></u> that spiral into violent, unpredictable encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>You’re a cop. The radio crackles. Multiple dispatch levels. Get to work.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine dispatch escalates into a violent confrontation with an underground streaming group known as Redstream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/7c731822a8fabe1e5dc3c538a8c71acc.poster.avif?t=1784870489\" width=766 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/7c731822a8fabe1e5dc3c538a8c71acc.webm?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/7c731822a8fabe1e5dc3c538a8c71acc.mp4?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Objectives</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure <strong><u>multiple SCENARIOS</u></strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront hostile threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate and rescue a missing girl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract delicate Proof</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the area alive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Systems</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unscripted Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scenario is system-driven, not scripted.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized enemy spawns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic threat placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fixed set-piece sequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough generates new pressure and uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/d3019644068c7f686db7ef3d5cddb90b.poster.avif?t=1784870489\" width=766 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/d3019644068c7f686db7ef3d5cddb90b.webm?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/d3019644068c7f686db7ef3d5cddb90b.mp4?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Physical Obejects and Ragdolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfights are raw and reactive. Enemies stagger, collapse, and writhe based on impact and direction — not preset death animations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll blending with live animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caliber influenced dismemberment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical Gore Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodies interacting with the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies do not collapse into preset death animations.<br>Encounters remain unstable and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Difficulty Structure</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited margin for error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast reaction-driven combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No character leveling or stat progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death resets the scenario</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress comes from player adaptation — not grinding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Setting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed suburban environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable narrative elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and Cheatcodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/c2d4549e00e0d74d6185a54010449cd9.poster.avif?t=1784870489\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/c2d4549e00e0d74d6185a54010449cd9.webm?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386260/extras/c2d4549e00e0d74d6185a54010449cd9.mp4?t=1784870489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Get</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player survival horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable, system-driven scenario</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature and violent atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MORE DLC SCENARIOS ARE PLANNED!</u></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRUE BODYCAM HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REDSTREAM: DISPATCH is a first-person bodycam survival horror experience where you <u><strong>respond to escalating dispatch calls</strong></u> that spiral into violent, unpredictable encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>You’re a cop. The radio crackles. Multiple d